notes.notes:
While working on the game update, we found and were also informed about several bugs. Thank you so much for reporting these issues to us!

FIXED:
— You couldn't use the slot machine if the banknote box upgrade was bought;
— Rapidly pressing buttons in the menu could open a new menu twice;
— Minor lighting changes;

We added hats!
— Added new screamers.    


Fixed bugs:  
— There were some problems with server connection, hopefully we've fixed them;

— Items no longer disappear in the elevator;

— Fixed a bug where it was impossible to exchange items for coins in single player; 

— Fixed some other bugs as well!


Happy working in B.A.N.K.!
